        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Stainless Steel (.050\" Thick)  8\" High Kick Plate\r\n</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese are made of Solid Stainless Steel and come with matching finish mounting screws. 8 Inch Tall door kick plates are available in 8 lengths from 28\" - 42\" and 3 different high quality finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>\r\nKick Plates are typically the width of the door less 2 inches.  If your door is 36 inches wide you would install a 34 inch wide kick plate. Please measure each door for proper fit.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Other Door Kick Plates Available:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-high-solid-brass-door-kick-plates\">6\" High Solid Brass</a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-high-solid-brass-door-kick-plates\">8\" High Solid Brass</a> <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-high-stainless-steel-door-kick-plates\">6\" High Stainless Steel</a>\r\n</p>\r\n</b>\r\n<br>",
